silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_4_DomesticCat#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode4 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode4 is the domestic-cat governed refinement leg of D_Mittens populated by the assertion that Mittens is a member of the domestic-cat class. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
